WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=yo.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.910
Fidio yii ṣe afihan bi o ṣe le ṣe

2
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.580
idanwo iwaju-ti-oju nipa lilo iwaju

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.957
keji lupu ti Arclight ẹrọ.

4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Bẹrẹ pẹlu mimọ ọwọ ati ṣafihan ararẹ.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Jẹrisi

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
idanimọ ti alaisan, ṣe alaye idanwo naa ati gba ifọwọsi lati ṣe.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Ni ibẹrẹ gba

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
iṣẹju diẹ lati ṣe akiyesi awọn oju mejeeji ni akoko kanna.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Wo periorbitor, ipenpeju ati

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
oju, asọye lori eyikeyi wiwu, Pupa ati yosita, bi daradara bi ọlá ti awọn oju

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
tabi ipo ipenpeju ajeji.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Lẹhinna ṣe idanwo ti o ga ni lilo ina arc.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Yipada lori ina funfun ki o si mu ẹrọ naa mọ si oju rẹ.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Laiyara sunmọ alaisan naa

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
oju ọtun ni akọkọ titi ti o fi wa ni idojukọ.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Eyi yoo jẹ nipa 6 cm.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Beere alaisan lati

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
gbe oju wọn si ita ati si inu, lẹhinna si oke ati isalẹ, lakoko ti wọn di ipenpeju wọn rọra,

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
ifinufindo akiyesi kan ti o yatọ si nmu be, lerongba ti wọn ni awọn ẹgbẹ.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Akọkọ

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Ẹgbẹ yii pẹlu awọn eyelashes oke ati isalẹ ati awọn ala ideri, keji pẹlu conjunctiva

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
ati sclera, ati isalẹ forenax.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Ẹgbẹ kẹta ni cornea, ipade ti eyi pẹlu sclera ti a npe ni

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
awọn limbis, ati

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
akẹẹkọ, ti yika nipasẹ awọn iris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Ni kete ti o ba ti pari akiyesi gbogbo awọn ẹya wọnyi, tẹsiwaju lati ṣe iṣiro ijinle iyẹwu iwaju.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
Iyẹwu iwaju jẹ aaye laarin cornea ati iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Nipa didan imọlẹ lati ẹgbẹ igba diẹ, ijinle ti iyẹwu iwaju

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
le ṣe ayẹwo.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Ojiji lori iris imu le daba iyẹwu iwaju aijinile.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Eyi jẹ idanwo deede laisi ojiji.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Bayi yan ina bulu lori ina arc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Pẹlu awọ fluorescing fiimu yiya, awọn agbegbe ti pipadanu epithelial ati arun yoo jẹ afihan.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Awọn awọ fluoresces didan pẹlu ina bulu.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
aworan atọka aaye ati iwọn awọn agbegbe ti pipadanu epithelial ati arun.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Ti pari nipa ṣiṣe ayẹwo awo tarsal ti o ga julọ, gbe egbọn owu kan si ideri oke,

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
ki o si rọra gbe awọn lashes soke nigba ti titẹ laiyara si isalẹ pẹlu awọn egbọn.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Ni ibẹrẹ ṣe akiyesi pẹlu oju ihoho, lẹhinna mu ina arc wa fun wiwo ti o ga.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Tun ayẹwo yii tun ni oju keji.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Lẹhinna, dupẹ lọwọ alaisan, ṣoki awọn igbasilẹ ti awọn awari ati tun ṣe mimọ ọwọ.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Jọwọ wo awọn fidio ile-ẹkọ giga ti St Andrews Arc Light miiran.
